# The image is built from the package source and the lockfile, nothing else. Everything is
# excluded, then only what the build needs is let back in. A new top-level file or folder
# the image needs (migrations, for example) must be added here.
#
# This keeps the local settings (.env), git history, runtime data and models (data/), the
# local environment (.venv), agent notes, the frontend, and the tests out of every build
# context.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!LICENSE
!marquee/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
